@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = paste-access-token-here
@postId = paste-post-id-here
@userId = paste-user-id-here

### Register (LAB-2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"learner_one","password":"password123"}

### Login (LAB-2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"learner_one","password":"password123"}

### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create post (LAB-3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"My first event-driven post"}

### Read thread
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}

### Reply directly to a post or reply
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/replies
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"text":"A nested reply"}

### Like idempotently
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/posts/{{postId}}/likes/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Follow idempotently
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}/follow
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Timeline (LAB-6)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/feed?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Search (LAB-5)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/search?q=event-driven&limit=20

